# Test Quality Standards
RULE: Expand existing test files; never create test_*_extended.py. Use singleton fixtures from conftest; mock external deps.
WHY: Duplicate files and fixtures cause maintenance burden; real GCS/API in unit tests slows gates.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/testing.md, .cursor/rules/no-duplicate-tests.mdc
DO: Add tests to existing test_config.py; use session/module scope fixtures; mock GCS, APIs
NEVER: Create test_config_extended.py; duplicate fixtures; use real GCS in unit tests; 500MB fixtures
